PackageIdentifier: degoya.rCommander
PackageVersion: @VERSION@
PackageLocale: en-US
Publisher: DEGOYA.digital
PublisherUrl: https://github.com/@OWNER@
PublisherSupportUrl: https://github.com/@REPOSITORY@/issues
PackageName: rCommander
PackageUrl: https://rcommander.net
License: GPL-3.0-or-later
LicenseUrl: https://github.com/@REPOSITORY@/blob/v@VERSION@/LICENSE
ShortDescription: Two-panel file manager with terminals, SSH and SFTP
Description: |-
  rCommander is a two-panel file manager in the tradition of Total Commander, written in Rust.
  Each panel shows a file list or a terminal; WSL distributions and SSH servers sit in the drive
  bar beside the local drives, and files are copied local to remote and remote to remote over
  SFTP and FTP/FTPS. A small connection manager keeps servers, keys and credentials encrypted
  behind an optional master password, and a built-in MCP server offers every action to AI agents.
  Installed through winget it does not replace itself: update it with
  `winget upgrade degoya.rCommander`.
Moniker: rcommander
Tags:
- file-manager
- orthodox-file-manager
- sftp
- ssh
- terminal
- total-commander
- wsl
